  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So the new update hit.\n\nI'd like to see some features that I consider important regarding this dynamic bone limiter.\n\nA few suggestions:\n\n- Add a slider to change the default values.\n\n- Allow custom values directly via ingame UI.\n\n- Make this setting a safety based one. Individual values for individual ranks.\n\n- Add a hint that Dynamic Bones are disabled because of the limit settings.\n\nThis discussion should not be about if this limiter is appreciated or not. Since people have very different opinions on this I'd like to see more accessible customization. \n\nIn my opinion this feature is not yet ready for public in it's current state.",
